.SH NAME
lean-secret - Encrypt and store secrets in .lean/secrets/


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean secret [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage encrypted secrets stored under .lean/secrets//.

.PP
Backends (lean.toml [secrets]):
  local  — AES-256-GCM
  gpg    — gpg -e -r 
  age    — age -r 
  ssh    — age with an SSH public key (same as age)

.PP
Master key for local backend:
  ~/.lean/key  (create with: lean secret keygen)
  or secrets.master_key_file in lean.toml

.PP
Examples:
  lean secret keygen
  lean secret put JWT_SECRET=supersecret
  lean secret get JWT_SECRET
  lean secret inject


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for secret


